      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manti%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Manti hosted the Mormon Miracle Pageant each summer for two weeks, a large outdoor reenactment of Book of Mormon stories.",
